  manualImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 63ace8c9000919c41929193315994baf, type: 3}
  manualDescription: Tall, thin humanoid anomaly with elongated legs, V-shaped shoulder extensions, and a single large eye floating above its body. Conceals itself in dark areas and advances toward the observation room whenever direct observation is interrupted.
  howToSpot: 'A dark, featureless shape clinging to a wall where the shadows shouldn''t
    be that solid. It cannot be reported: hold the mouse pointer on it until it fades
    away. Look away and it comes back.'
