  manualBehavior: HOSTILE
  threatLevel: 3
  threatLevelLabel: SEVERE
  manualResponse: O.T.U. AUTHORIZED
  manualDetection: "VISUAL — LOW-LIGHT"
  manualProcedure: Search dark corners using the camera flashlight. Look for the floating eye. Maintain direct illumination until the anomaly disappears.
  manualWarning: DO NOT LOOK AWAY BEFORE NEUTRALIZATION.
